  <!-- Purpose -->
  <section class="section" id="purpose">
    <div class="purpose">
      <div class="col-l">
        <p class="eyebrow">Our purpose</p>
        <h2>Advancing<br>culture in <em>multicultural Australia.</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="col-r">
        <p class="lede">ICCL exists to advance culture in Australia — through festivals, events and programs that reflect the country's multicultural reality and foster intercultural understanding, community connection and social cohesion.</p>
        <p>We are a small, volunteer-led charity that focuses narrowly on doing a few things well. Our flagship is MOMO Fest Melbourne. Beyond it, we partner with artists, food producers, councils and communities to bring public cultural programming to life.</p>

        <div class="principle">
          <blockquote>
            "To advance culture in Australia by curating, producing and presenting festivals, events and programs with a focus on arts, culture and heritage representing multicultural Australia — while <em>fostering intercultural understanding and social cohesion.</em>"
          </blockquote>
          <cite>— Principal object · Constitution adopted 27 August 2025</cite>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Scope / what we do -->
  <section class="section" id="scope" style="background: var(--cream);">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <p class="section-label">Our constitutional scope</p>
        <h2 class="section-title-plain">What ICCL is set up to do.</h2>
      </div>
      <p class="lede">Our constitution authorises a broad range of cultural, educational, artistic and community activities. These define our capacity — not all are active yet. As a new organisation with one confirmed festival, we'll grow into the rest deliberately.</p>
    </div>

    <div style="max-width: var(--content); margin-inline: auto; padding-inline: var(--gutter);">
      <div class="scope">
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">i.</div>
          <h4>Cultural programming</h4>
          <p>Festivals, performances, exhibitions, screenings, talks, culinary and craft programs, flagship and touring events.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">ii.</div>
          <h4>Artist support</h4>
          <p>Residencies, mentorships, workshops, awards and support for artists and cultural practitioners where funds permit.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">iii.</div>
          <h4>Education &amp; engagement</h4>
          <p>Audience, participant and volunteer programs; school and university engagement; accessibility initiatives.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">iv.</div>
          <h4>Documentation &amp; preservation</h4>
          <p>Digital content, archives, recordings and documentation preserving cultural works and heritage.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">v.</div>
          <h4>Partnerships</h4>
          <p>Collaboration with governments, councils, First Nations peoples, cultural bodies, education institutions, charities and international networks.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="scope-item">
          <div class="key">vi.</div>
          <h4>Cultural tourism</h4>
          <p>Cultural tourism activities, touring programs and collaboration with organisations in Australia and overseas with similar purposes.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

